{
    "word": "wedle",
    "lang_code": "pl",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "b235160c-f5e3-373f-bbcb-36bdd1ef535e",
                "word": "wedle",
                "pos": "prep",
                "lang_code": "pl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "29c62542-b78f-351f-996e-011a87609a71",
                        "entry_id": "b235160c-f5e3-373f-bbcb-36bdd1ef535e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "according to"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "with-genitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6aadf86-4ab4-42bd-bdfe-7abf0548d404",
                                "sense_id": "29c62542-b78f-351f-996e-011a87609a71",
                                "text": "...kłámáli, zwodźili, á zmieniáli wedle czásu słowá swoie.",
                                "translation": "...they lied, deceived, and changed their words according to the time.",
                                "english": "...they lied, deceived, and changed their words according to the time."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cc8e04cf-de83-4fe9-be8b-65ac6e188db2",
                                "sense_id": "29c62542-b78f-351f-996e-011a87609a71",
                                "text": "- Rycerze króla Artura zasiadali wedle tradycji przy takim okrągłym stole, przy którym żadne miejsce nie było uprzywilejowane - mówi dr Janusz Sibora, badacz dziejów dyplomacji.",
                                "translation": "\"King Arthur's knights sat down, according to tradition, at a round table like this, at which no place was privileged,\" says Dr. Janusz Sibora, a student of the history of diplomacy.",
                                "english": "\"King Arthur's knights sat down, according to tradition, at a round table like this, at which no place was privileged,\" says Dr. Janusz Sibora, a student of the history of diplomacy."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fff469c7-efd5-474f-a254-8b6b21773e05",
                                "sense_id": "29c62542-b78f-351f-996e-011a87609a71",
                                "text": "Spadek religijności młodzieży jest miażdżący. Wedle nieocenionego abp. Jędraszewskiego to nie wina Kościoła, lecz diabelskiej elektroniki: młodzi pochylają głowy nad smartfonami i komputerami, zamiast słuchać rodziców, dziadków i katechetów.",
                                "translation": "The fall in religiousness among the youth is crushing. According to the unranked Archbishop Jędraszewski, this isn't the Church's fault, but that of devilish electronics: young people bow their heads over smartphones and computers instead of listening to their parents, grandparents, and catechists.",
                                "english": "The fall in religiousness among the youth is crushing. According to the unranked Archbishop Jędraszewski, this isn't the Church's fault, but that of devilish electronics: young people bow their heads over smartphones and computers instead of listening to their parents, grandparents, and catechists."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "229b06ac-fc69-43e2-9143-f6164e320e92",
                                "sense_id": "29c62542-b78f-351f-996e-011a87609a71",
                                "text": "Wedle reguł podanych przez FIVB, aby być w grupie 11 drużyn obecnych w 2024 roku na turnieju w Paryżu (12. jest Francja), można wywalczyć to prawo poprzez jeden z trzech turniejów kwalifikacyjnych zaplanowanych na jesień 2023 roku.",
                                "translation": "According to the rules given by FIVB [the International Volleyball Federation], in order to be in the group of 11 teams present in 2024 at the competition in Paris (the 12th will be France), you can win that right in one of three qualifying competitions planned for the fall of 2023.",
                                "english": "According to the rules given by FIVB [the International Volleyball Federation], in order to be in the group of 11 teams present in 2024 at the competition in Paris (the 12th will be France), you can win that right in one of three qualifying competitions planned for the fall of 2023."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2805f7c1-4f15-481f-989b-7d10cbe3cc07",
                                "sense_id": "29c62542-b78f-351f-996e-011a87609a71",
                                "text": "Kto powinien wchodzić w jej skład i wedle jakich zasad ma funkcjonować?",
                                "translation": "Who should be included in its composition and what rules should it function according to?",
                                "english": "Who should be included in its composition and what rules should it function according to?"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "be54915a-7b64-3eb4-9e35-2de7b5f17528",
                        "entry_id": "b235160c-f5e3-373f-bbcb-36bdd1ef535e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "next to, near, beside"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "with-genitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3953522b-0876-438b-a2b3-4bea3119daa3",
                                "sense_id": "be54915a-7b64-3eb4-9e35-2de7b5f17528",
                                "text": "Wjechali nakoniec w jakąś szczelinę skalną długą i prostą, a tak wąską, że zaledwie trzech ludzi mogło jechać wedle siebie.",
                                "translation": "They rode, at last, into some long, straight, stony ravine, so narrow that only three people could ride alongside each other.",
                                "english": "They rode, at last, into some long, straight, stony ravine, so narrow that only three people could ride alongside each other."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eeb0cde5-128c-4769-a0a6-d7614382826a",
                                "sense_id": "be54915a-7b64-3eb4-9e35-2de7b5f17528",
                                "text": "U nas wedle stawu grobla.",
                                "translation": "Where we live, there's a dike on one side of the reservoir.",
                                "english": "Where we live, there's a dike on one side of the reservoir."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5cada6e-b62c-4c9c-9453-41404d51d91e",
                                "sense_id": "be54915a-7b64-3eb4-9e35-2de7b5f17528",
                                "text": "...jak zwykle wedle parku przejeżdża.",
                                "translation": "...as usual, he drives by the park.",
                                "english": "...as usual, he drives by the park."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "86b30f67-0f9a-301d-88df-5b972d1077e0",
                        "entry_id": "b235160c-f5e3-373f-bbcb-36bdd1ef535e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "along"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "with-genitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7b5b683-6e6b-430a-bbdc-6716d6223b16",
                                "sense_id": "86b30f67-0f9a-301d-88df-5b972d1077e0",
                                "text": "Dookoła gaje, pola\nI łężne rozłogi,\nKrzywe wierzby, jak im wola,\nRosną wedle drogi.",
                                "translation": "All around, there are groves, fields,\nand flood-plains;\ncrooked willows, as they will,\ngrow along the road.",
                                "english": "All around, there are groves, fields,\nand flood-plains;\ncrooked willows, as they will,\ngrow along the road."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4dd54c6f-d241-48ba-a128-f92af7940d8b",
                                "sense_id": "86b30f67-0f9a-301d-88df-5b972d1077e0",
                                "text": "– Pani baronowa może być spokojna – odparł tubalnym głosem. – Pojedziemy dokładnie wedle drogi, już moja w tym głowa.",
                                "translation": "\"The baroness can calm down,\" he replied in a voice as loud as a tuba. \"We will go precisely along the road, you can depend on me.\"",
                                "english": "\"The baroness can calm down,\" he replied in a voice as loud as a tuba. \"We will go precisely along the road, you can depend on me.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
